# Service boot / component scan

## market-service (`MarketServiceApplication`)

Must include (directly or via `@Import`):

- `com.dyx.market.trigger.http`, `trigger.rpc`
- `com.dyx.market.trigger.application`, `trigger.support`, `trigger.adapter` (BM-001)
- `domain`, `infrastructure`, `com.dyx.market.market`

Must **exclude**: `trigger.job`, `trigger.listener` (owned by message-job).

## message-job-service (`MessageJobServiceApplication`)

Must include: `message.job`, `trigger.job`, `trigger.listener`, `domain`, `infrastructure`, and `trigger.application` (or import services used by consumers/jobs — BM-002).

Must **exclude**: `trigger.http`, `trigger.rpc`.

## Tests

Any scan/`@Import` change needs a `@SpringBootTest` context load for that service. Compilation alone does not catch missing beans.
